WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.995
Polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons resist easy

00:00:03.995 --> 00:00:04.778
dispersion

00:00:04.778 --> 00:00:08.852
in aqueous environments. Polymer assemblies offer one

00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:10.927
route to changing exposure.

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:19.398
Amphiphilic polymer micelles can provide compartments

00:00:19.398 --> 00:00:19.611
for

00:00:19.611 --> 00:00:23.092
hydrophobic compounds. The thermodynamic argument

00:00:23.092 --> 00:00:23.518
begins

00:00:23.518 --> 00:00:25.402
before the mixture is made.

00:00:29.925 --> 00:00:33.769
Actual diblock-copolymer handling and dissolution did

00:00:33.769 --> 00:00:33.987
not

00:00:33.987 --> 00:00:37.835
always match our expectations. This archive retains an

00:00:37.835 --> 00:00:39.546
unsuccessful experiment.

00:00:43.925 --> 00:00:47.790
Micellisation depends on solvent, composition and real

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:51.580
processing. No neat drawing replaces measurements on

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:51.799
the

00:00:51.799 --> 00:00:53.588
system actually prepared.

00:00:58.008 --> 00:01:01.092
The difference between an ideal formulation and a

00:01:01.092 --> 00:01:04.489
workable one can be a physical materials problem, not

00:01:04.489 --> 00:01:04.553
a

00:01:04.553 --> 00:01:06.252
failure to know the theory.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:13.662
The grant-supported investigation and its trials

00:01:13.662 --> 00:01:14.103
belong

00:01:14.103 --> 00:01:17.640
in the scientific account without manufacturing a

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.021
successful solubilisation result.
